---
const paths = [
  ['Partnerships','Institutions, teams, and people exploring a problem together.'],
  ['Ideas & initiatives','Early thinking that could become meaningful work.'],
  ['Careers','People interested in building, learning, and taking ownership.'],
];
---
<div class="co-sub co-careers">
  <section class="co-sub-hero"><div class="co-sub-wrap co-sub-hero-grid"><div><p class="co-kicker">CAREERS &amp; CONTACT</p><h1>Good work starts<br/>with a <em>conversation.</em></h1><p class="co-lead">Have a problem worth exploring, an idea worth testing, or a perspective that could make the work better? Start here.</p></div><div class="co-contact-art"><span>OPEN CHANNEL</span><strong>Let’s<br/><em>connect.</em></strong><i>↗</i><small>E DEVİSER / 01</small></div></div></section>
  <section class="co-sub-section"><div class="co-sub-wrap"><p class="co-kicker">WHAT BRINGS YOU HERE?</p><div class="co-sub-heading"><h2>Different starting points.<br/><em>One thoughtful conversation.</em></h2><p>We are interested in conversations that can lead to useful work—not volume for its own sake.</p></div><div class="co-paths">{paths.map((path,i)=><article><span>0{i+1}</span><div><h3>{path[0]}</h3><p>{path[1]}</p></div><b>↗</b></article>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="co-sub-section co-sub-tint"><div class="co-sub-wrap co-open"><div><p class="co-kicker">CAREERS</p><h2>Bring curiosity.<br/><em>Bring the willingness to build.</em></h2></div><div><p>We value people who question assumptions, care about the details, and can turn ideas into practical progress. We are not listing unconfirmed vacancies here; when opportunities are formally open, they will be published with clear role expectations.</p><a href="/company/team/">Meet the team ↗</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="co-sub-section co-contact" id="contact"><div class="co-sub-wrap co-contact-panel"><div><p class="co-kicker">START A CONVERSATION</p><h2>Tell us what<br/><em>you’re thinking.</em></h2><p>For now, contact channels are being finalized. This page will be updated with verified contact details and application instructions rather than publishing an unmonitored or guessed address.</p></div><div class="co-contact-status"><span>CONTACT INFORMATION</span><strong>Being finalized</strong><small>Check back soon for the official contact route.</small><a href="/company/">Back to company overview ↗</a></div></div></section>
</div>
<style>
.co-sub{--sub-bg:#07121d;--sub-text:#f5f9fb;--sub-muted:#aabac5;--sub-line:#29404d;background:var(--sub-bg);color:var(--sub-text);overflow:hidden}.co-sub *{box-sizing:border-box}.co-sub-wrap{width:min(88rem,calc(100% - 3rem));margin:auto}.co-sub-section{padding:clamp(4.5rem,8vw,8rem) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--sub-line)}.co-sub-tint{background:#0a1926}.co-kicker{margin:0 0 1.5rem;color:var(--brand-teal-light);font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:var(--text-xs);font-weight:var(--weight-bold);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-wide);text-transform:uppercase}.co-sub h1,.co-sub h2{margin:1rem 0 1.5rem;font-size:clamp(2.7rem,5.5vw,5.6rem);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.06em}.co-sub h1 em,.co-sub h2 em{font-style:normal;color:#70c8d0}.co-sub p{color:var(--sub-muted);line-height:1.8}.co-sub-hero{padding:clamp(5rem,9vw,9rem) 0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 78% 45%,#0382bd25,transparent 40%)}.co-sub-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .8fr;gap:8vw;align-items:center}.co-lead{max-width:39rem;font-size:1.08rem}.co-contact-art{min-height:24rem;position:relative;padding:2rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;border:1px solid #5ab9b477;background:radial-gradient(circle at 70% 30%,#0382bd38,transparent 55%),linear-gradient(145deg,#102b3a,#08131e)}.co-contact-art>span,.co-contact-art>small{font:500 .6rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.14em;color:#9acbd0}.co-contact-art strong{font-size:clamp(3rem,5vw,5rem);line-height:1.02;margin:2rem 0}.co-contact-art em{font-style:normal;color:#70c8d0}.co-contact-art i{position:absolute;right:2rem;bottom:2rem;font-size:2rem;color:#70c8d0;font-style:normal}.co-contact-art>small{position:absolute;bottom:1.5rem;left:2rem}.co-sub-heading,.co-open,.co-contact-panel{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .8fr;gap:8vw;align-items:center}.co-sub-heading>p,.co-open>div:last-child{max-width:38rem}.co-paths{margin-top:3rem;border-top:1px solid var(--sub-line)}.co-paths article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr 2rem;gap:1.2rem;align-items:center;padding:1.5rem .3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--sub-line)}.co-paths article>span{font:600 .65rem var(--font-mono);color:#70c8d0}.co-paths h3{font-size:1.35rem;margin:0}.co-paths p{margin:.4rem 0 0;font-size:.9rem}.co-paths article>b{color:#70c8d0;font-weight:400}.co-open h2,.co-contact-panel h2{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4.4vw,4.6rem)}.co-open a,.co-contact-status a{display:inline-block;margin-top:1rem;color:#a5e1e0;text-decoration:none;font-weight:650;font-size:.85rem}.co-contact{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 50%,#0382bd20,transparent 48%)}.co-contact-panel{padding:2.5rem;border:1px solid var(--sub-line);background:#0a1926}.co-contact-status{padding:2rem;border-left:1px solid var(--sub-line)}.co-contact-status span,.co-contact-status small{display:block;font:500 .6rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.12em;color:#70c8d0}.co-contact-status strong{display:block;margin:1.5rem 0 .5rem;font-size:1.8rem}.co-contact-status small{color:#8299a6;line-height:1.7}
@media(max-width:760px){.co-sub-hero-grid,.co-sub-heading,.co-open,.co-contact-panel{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}.co-contact-status{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--sub-line);padding:1.5rem 0 0}.co-sub-wrap{width:calc(100% - 2rem)}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.co-sub *{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
</style>